N5008 [temp.arg.explicit]/4 + [temp.variadic]/4,7.  A trailing template parameter
pack given an EMPTY explicit argument list (`make_box<>()`) whose return type is
a non-bare pack-expansion (`box<typename identity<E>::type...>`) is deduced as an
empty sequence, so arity(make_box<>()) == 0.  Previously the empty pack (only a
pack_size_map size-0 entry, no pack_args_map/pack_expr_map entry) was not
recognised in the non-bare pattern, so the argument stayed an unresolved bare
pack reference and the candidate was dropped ("found no match").  Fixed by also
collecting empty packs from pack_size_map when gathering a pattern's referenced
packs.  Non-vacuous: arity is a genuine run-time sizeof...(E).
